        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "markdown_ar": "**التعبير عن الحب:** like / don't like:\n\n- I **like** okra. / I **don't like** garlic.\n- He **likes** carrots. / She **doesn't like** onions.\n- **Do you like** aubergine? — Yes, I do. / No, I don't.\n\nمع الأسماء المعدودة نستخدم الجمع بعد like: «I like **tomatoes**.»"
